          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Prodash Messages 按最新消息在上排列。把多行 trace 拆成独立消息会倒转阅读顺序，\n因此建议 Feed 只发一行主错误摘要；完整原文在退出后的 Failures 中按原顺序输出。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
