          "type": "text",
          "id": "RFHdO",
          "name": "截断与脱敏",
          "fill": "#486983",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "屏幕摘要允许省略，但完整报告不丢 trace / 位置 / 缩进。URL 保留 host/path，移除凭据、\nquery 与 fragment。剥离 ANSI / 非打印控制符仅用于安全显示，不改写 got: 的解析输入。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xPGps",
          "name": "实现说明",
          "fill": "#344253",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "需要在解析层保留完整诊断块与可显示摘要，而非向 Item::message 直接传多行字符串。\n当前 Nix msg 的 level / trace / position 尚未完整传递；该原型属于明确的待适配项。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
