                  "fill": "#344253",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "主面板宽度需扣除 Information 与 counter；origin 为完整 Item 名。\n库能重排，但应用截断预算当前仍使用启动尺寸，需要同步 resize。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
