          "name": "开发边界",
          "fill": "#344253",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "不换 Prodash，不增加自定义 dashboard，不做搜索 / 详情弹窗 / 重试按钮。\n新增的是应用层显示策略与日志归一化；状态源仍是当前 Progress / Reporter。",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 15,
